<%-
  # @request is an ExemptionRequest
  # @repository is a Repository
  # @reason is a String
-%>
<%= @title %>

<%= "Repository: #{@repository.name_with_display_owner}" %>
<%= "Time: #{@request.created_at}" %>

<%= "Alert title:" %>
<%= "  - #{@request.metadata["alert_title"]}" %>

<% if @closure_reason.present? %>
Reason: <%= @closure_reason %>
<% end %>

<% if @closure_detail.present? %>
Detail: <%= @closure_detail %>
<% end %>

<% if @request.requester_comment.present? %>

Your comment: "<%= @request.requester_comment %>"
<% end %>

Your request is now pending review. You will be notified when a reviewer responds.

View alert details: <%= @permalink %>

<%= @reason %>
